	<section_number>1-207</section_number>
	<catch_line>Child; juvenile; minor; infant</catch_line>
	<text>
		"Child," "juvenile," "minor," "infant," or any combination thereof means a person less than 18 years of age.
	</text>
	<history>1972, cc. 824, 825, § 1-13.42; 2005, c. 839.</history>
</law>
